  "description": "The timebase master disappears mid-show. The follower drops out of sync after three missed TICKs, stands for election, and takes the role two seconds later with the election epoch incremented — at which point it is synced again by definition. The suppression window between `sync_lost` and `sync_acquired` is bounded and defined; see vectors/README.md on what a single-machine vector can and cannot say about visible interruption.",
